386
00:16:10,578 --> 00:16:13,494
Yes, but souls were healed.
This was a cathartic brawl.

387
00:16:13,581 --> 00:16:16,192
It was-it was
a therapeutic expression of..

388
00:16:16,279 --> 00:16:17,889
[footsteps]

389
