He could be our angry caller.

395
00:16:31,207 --> 00:16:32,600
Go to Gallatin.
Take Van Pelt with you.

396
00:16:32,687 --> 00:16:34,036
Okay.

397
00:16:34,123 --> 00:16:36,604
You go to hell.
Take a toothbrush.

398
00:16:36,691 --> 00:16:38,127
Which way is that?

399
00:16:38,867 --> 00:16:39,999
I'll go.

400
00:16:42,088 --> 00:16:43,872
[laughs]

401
00:16:43,959 --> 00:16:45,569
