I got your Derek Logan
update right here.

407
00:16:54,926 --> 00:16:56,885
Ah.

408
00:16:56,972 --> 00:16:59,018
Kid's life never turned
the corner.

409
00:16:59,105 --> 00:17:01,498
Derek Michael Logan
left Rancho Rosa

410
00:17:01,585 --> 00:17:03,326
