after the Selby incident.

411
00:17:03,413 --> 00:17:06,286
Family moved to Virginia.
He became a heroin addict.

412
00:17:06,373 --> 00:17:08,462
Couple years
in and out of rehab.

413
00:17:08,549 --> 00:17:10,812
He died of an overdose
on his 23rd birthday.

414
00:17:10,899 --> 00:17:13,858
School office has sent over
his old student ID.

415
00:17:13,945 --> 00:17:15,599
- From their archives?
- Mm-hmm.

416
