Well, in this case,
they don't.

421
00:17:30,005 --> 00:17:31,311
Mm.

422
00:17:31,398 --> 00:17:33,835
- How sad.
- 'Mm.'

423
00:17:33,922 --> 00:17:35,837
And I was betting
on Derek Logan as our killer.

424
00:17:37,230 --> 00:17:38,709
Will you quit yanking
me around?

425
00:17:38,796 --> 00:17:40,146
Okay, if you can't get it right,
