beech wood.

428
00:17:46,065 --> 00:17:48,067
Hey, Terence Badali?
CBI.

429
00:17:48,154 --> 00:17:50,112
Need to talk to you about
Jana Vickers.

430
00:17:50,199 --> 00:17:52,332
I'll call you back.
What about her?

431
00:17:52,419 --> 00:17:53,463
You left
