434
00:17:57,119 --> 00:17:59,513
Because an innocent person
would say, I didn't do it.

435
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,905
So what? I called her.
Big deal.

436
00:18:00,992 --> 00:18:02,646
You called her
and threatened her

437
00:18:02,733 --> 00:18:05,214
now she and her husband have
been found killed, and so..

438
00:18:05,301 --> 00:18:06,433
[screams]

439
00:18:14,049 --> 00:18:15,181
[grunts]

440
00:18:16,486 --> 00:18:17,618
You're under arrest.

441
00:18:19,402 --> 00:18:21,143
[groans]

442
00:18:24,146 --> 00:18:25,452
I panicked.

443
00:18:25,539 --> 00:18:26,757
As soon as you told me they
were dead

444
00:18:26,844 --> 00:18:27,802
I knew you were gonna
blame me

445
00:18:27,889 --> 00:18:29,499
and my brain said, "just run."

446
00:18:29,586 --> 00:18:31,893
Your brain's a fool.
Where were you last night?

447
00:18:31,980 --> 00:18:33,112
I was watching college ball.

448
00:18:35,810 --> 00:18:37,116
Can you prove that?

449
00:18:37,203 --> 00:18:38,291
Notre Dame sucked.

450
00:18:41,685 --> 00:18:42,991
I live alone..

451
00:18:43,078 --> 00:18:44,775
