bitch left me.

452
00:18:44,862 --> 00:18:46,777
She and you had
a sexual relationship?

453
00:18:46,864 --> 00:18:49,040
Well, she was my fiancee.

454
00:18:49,128 --> 00:18:50,477
I met her through
this Internet service.

455
00:18:50,564 --> 00:18:52,131
Uh, you-you pay
a whole bunch of money

456
00:18:52,218 --> 00:18:54,307
but you get to choose from
these videos and then they bring

457
00:18:54,394 --> 00:18:56,178
