and she marries you.

458
00:18:56,265 --> 00:18:58,180
- That's a good deal.
- Oh, I tell you, man.

459
00:18:58,267 --> 00:18:59,616
These Eastern European types

460
00:18:59,703 --> 00:19:01,879
they know how to take care
of their men.

461
00:19:01,966 --> 00:19:03,577
Right. What happened?

462
00:19:03,664 --> 00:19:05,840
Well, she left me for
this Vickers guy.

463
00:19:05,927 --> 00:19:07,929
She comes to me one day
says she met this guy at work

464
00:19:08,016 --> 00:19:09,670
they fell in love..

465
00:19:09,757 --> 00:19:11,933
- Must've made you angry.
- 'Yeah, you bet it did.'

466
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:13,630
So you threaten to kill them
unless they pay you off.

467
00:19:13,717 --> 00:19:16,981
No, no, no. I threatened
to turn her in to the INS.

468
00:19:17,068 --> 00:19:19,897
Because she had lied about
all these things on her form.

469
00:19:19,984 --> 00:19:22,073
She was in this country
under false pretenses.

470
00:19:22,161 --> 00:19:23,510
How much
were you asking for?

471
00:19:23,597 --> 00:19:25,033
Well, I just wanted
my money back.

472
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:27,209
The money I put up
to get her over here.

473
00:19:27,296 --> 00:19:30,299
I saved all my receipts.
It was 25 grand.

474
00:19:30,386 --> 00:19:32,171
Well, and 5 grand
for emotional suffering.

475
00:19:32,258 --> 00:19:33,215
And what was her response?

476
00:19:33,302 --> 00:19:34,564
She said they'd pay it.

477
00:19:34,651 --> 00:19:35,826
She admitted she owed
me the money.

478
00:19:35,913 --> 00:19:37,219
They were broke.

479
00:19:37,306 --> 00:19:39,134
Any idea where they were
gonna get the money?

480
00:19:39,221 --> 00:19:40,744
Jana said that Selby was gonna
get it from an old friend.

481
00:19:42,224 --> 00:19:43,399
They guaranteed Badali
they'd have it

482
00:19:43,486 --> 00:19:45,401
for him Monday in cash.

483
00:19:45,488 --> 00:19:48,230
At least we know Selby's
sudden interest in the reunion.

484
00:19:48,317 --> 00:19:51,059
He was protecting his wife.
It's kind of romantic.

485
00:19:51,146 --> 00:19:53,322
- Noble, even.
- Ugh. Motive, even.

486
00:19:53,409 --> 00:19:55,194
He must have asked
somebody for money

487
